# DebugViz — monorepo

| Path | Stack |
|------|-------|
| `server/` | Node.js, Fastify, WebSocket |
| `web/` | Vite, React, TypeScript, Three.js |
| `rust/layout/` | WASM force-directed layout (wasm-pack) |
| `demo/http|grpc|cli|worker/` | Go demos |
| `schemas/` | graph + trace JSON Schema |

Ports (docker compose): UI `:3000`, debug-server `:4000`, demo/http `:8080`.

pnpm workspaces: `server`, `web`. CI: `go test`, `pnpm test`, `wasm-pack build`.
